# Server-side secrets for Lane's Supabase Edge Functions (see supabase/README.md, "Driver coach").
# Copy this file to supabase/functions/.env (gitignored), paste the key after the =, then send it to
# Supabase with:
#   npx supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/functions/.env --project-ref mtcphmkheqkzyvbvruey
# The key is billed to your Anthropic account. Never put it in a VITE_ variable, the app or the repo.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
